@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}

### Analyze dataset
# Expected: 200 OK on valid signed-in request, 400 on invalid body, 401 when session is missing, or 429 on rate limit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/analyze
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: authjs.session-token=<paste-local-session-cookie>

{
  "datasetId": "<paste-owned-dataset-id>",
  "query": "Summarize the main revenue and cost trends.",
  "mode": "chat"
}
